WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.714 --> 00:00:08.812
Entry: the composer opens on "Shared IT teams" and Alice posts without touching it

2
00:00:08.812 --> 00:00:11.583
Entry: re-selecting the displayed "Shared IT teams" (the original probe step) posts the same audience

3
00:00:11.583 --> 00:00:14.338
Entry: a "Private to White Rabbit IT" note is stored organization-private

4
00:00:14.338 --> 00:00:18.755
Grid: the bento composer highlights "Shared IT teams" and posts it

5
00:00:18.755 --> 00:00:23.412
Positive control: a "Requester and IT teams" reply is requester-visible and mailed to the requester

6
00:00:23.412 --> 00:00:25.659
Delivery: the requester receives only the requester reply (database rows and SMTP sink)

7
00:00:25.659 --> 00:00:28.950
Reload: the timeline keeps each note under its audience
